==Battleground==
*1 [[Sir Metal Seal]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Sir Metal Seal]]s spawn, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Loris|Lorises]] spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**3 [[Metal One Horn]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage consists of tanky Metal enemies with [[Long Distance]] support from Lorises. To handle this combination of enemies, use high damage Critters such as [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Soba Cat]] as well as cats that can consistently [[Critical Hit]] like [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]]. [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Future Cat]] is very useful, able to stall every major threat in this stage, while costing mere pennies. [[Wave Attack|Wave]] attackers like [[Hermit Cat (Special Cat)|Masked Grandmaster Cat]] are recommended to deal some heavy damage the Lorises and knock them back on occasion. They will be persistently annoying and continually target your midranged and melee critters, so be careful.

